OL,5,G1225 Love Your Garden
OL,6,     FAlan Titchmarsh and the team look
OL,7,     Fto the natural world for
OL,8,     Finspiration this time and create a
OL,9,     Fwild and woolly garden that's
OL,10,     Fperfect for a deserving young
OL,11,     Ffamily in Middlesbrough. Despite
OL,12,     Fhaving physical challenges of her
OL,13,     Fown, young mum Phillipa supports
OL,14,     Fother disabled families and
OL,15,     Findividuals in the area, going
OL,16,     Fabove and beyond to make sure they
OL,17,     Fhave all the help they need. The
OL,18,     Fgarden features a mini-dinosaur
OL,19,     Fkingdom play area, a
OL,20,     Fnatural-looking water feature and
OL,21,     Fa vertical grow-your-own vegetable
OL,22,     Fplot, and the team succeeds in
